  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional develop.plan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionala utvecklingsplan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetsprojekt inriktat p&#xE5; arbete med en regional utvecklingsplan f&#xF6;r olika l&#xE4;n i Litauen utifr&#xE5;n ett demokrati-perspektiv. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att integrera ett demokratit&#xE4;nkande och nya arbetsmetoder inom detta omr&#xE5;de. Svensk genomf&#xF6;rande samarbetspart &#xE4;r L&#xE4;nsstyrelsen i J&#xF6;nk&#xF6;png. Sidas bidrag omfattar SEK 1 194 200 f&#xF6;r 2000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to help the Lituanian counties in their work with developing regional development plans in a democratic way. The result would be an integration of a democratic thinking as well as new working methods in this area. Swedish part is the County Administrative Board of J&#xF6;nk&#xF6;ping.Support: 1 194 200 SEK</narrative>
  </description>
